<title>UK: UK debt management report out on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>UK debt management report out on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The British Treasury said on Tuesday that its debt management report will be published at 1530 GMT on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The report will include the 1997/98 funding remit -- the amount of government bonds that will have to be issued to cover government borrowing and pay redemptions of existing bonds.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5109</p>
